<view class="game"><view class="game-kicker">{{type}} · 开启今日小幸运</view><view wx:if="{{type==='幸运转盘'}}" class="wheel-wrap"><view class="wheel"><view class="wheel-label l1">幸运权益</view><view class="wheel-label l2">谢谢参与</view><view class="wheel-label l3">2注好礼</view><view class="wheel-label l4">好运相伴</view></view><view class="wheel-button" bindtap="play">去抽奖<text>✦</text></view><view class="pointer"></view></view><view wx:elif="{{type==='刮刮乐'}}" class="scratch" bindtap="play"><text class="scratch-title">藏一份幸运，给今天的你</text><view class="scratch-mask"><text>✧</text><text>点击开启刮刮乐</text></view><text class="scratch-note">确认参与后揭晓结果</text></view><view wx:elif="{{type==='九宫格'}}" class="nine-grid"><view class="grid-cell {{index===4?'grid-center':''}}" wx:for="{{[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8]}}" wx:key="*this" bindtap="play"><text>{{index===4?'开启幸运':index%2===0?'✧':'◇'}}</text><text wx:if="{{index!==4}}" class="grid-small">{{index%2===0?'幸运权益':'好运相伴'}}</text></view></view><view wx:else class="direct" bindtap="play"><view>✦</view><text>一份见面礼，等你来领取</text><text class="direct-button">立即领取 →</text></view><view class="game-note">图案为玩法展示，是否中奖以 mock 服务结果为准</view></view>
